ame":"Florian Fricke","role":"Florian","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qa5a0Q28i8wnHbz9KUv2ykAuAr6.jpg"},{"id":1013897,"name":"Alfred Edel","role":"Logic Professor"},{"id":1464199,"name":"Franz Brumbach","role":"bear showman"},{"id":45808,"name":"Herbert Fritsch","role":"Mayor","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h1X4dlUHaA5JZmdVM4FCB2rVcRx.jpg"},{"id":1464200,"name":"Wilhelm Bayer","role":"employee of the captain"},{"id":1464201,"name":"Peter Gebhart","role":"man who finds Kaspar"},{"id":1464202,"name":"Otto Heinzle","role":"old priest"},{"id":1464203,"name":"Dorothea Kraft","role":"little girl"},{"id":1464204,"name":"Dr. Walter Pflaum","role":"Doctor #2"},{"id":1464205,"name":"Dr. Heinz Niemöller","role":"Doctor #3"},{"id":1464206,"name":"Peter-Udo Schönborn","role":"crier"},{"id":1464207,"name":"Markus Weller","role":"Julius"},{"id":234362,"name":"Reinhard Hauff","role":"Bauer - role was cut","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/TCNZfVcChxJ36ex7lLSqcnI9cH.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"L'enigma di Kaspar Hauser","overview":"Nel 1824 nella piazza principale di Norimberga fa la sua comparsa un giovane che non sa parlare, maltenuto e cencioso. Dopo una serie di penose umiliazioni, il giovane viene preso in cura da un medico che riesce a ottenere da lui progressi insperati. Forse il giovane è un nobile di cui la famiglia si è disfatta per oscure ragioni dinastiche. Un giorno però, così come era apparso, il ragazzo scompare."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Enigma of Kaspar Hauser","overview":"The film follows Kaspar Hauser, who lived the first seventeen years of his life chained in a tiny cellar with only a toy horse to occupy his time, devoid of all human contact except for a man who wears a black overcoat and top hat who feeds him."},{"language":"de-DE","title":"Kaspar Hauser - Jeder für sich und Gott gegen alle","overview":"Die Geschichte des rätselhaften Findlings Kaspar Hauser. Der sein Lebtag lang in einem Kellerloch eingesperrt war, ohne jeden Begriff von der Welt. Der nicht weiß, dass es außer ihm noch Menschen gibt. Der nicht weiß, was ein Baum, ein Haus, was Sprache ist. Der eines Tages mitten in Nürnberg ausgesetzt wird. Der auf mysteriöse Weise ermordet wird. War er ein badischer Prinz oder gar ein Sohn Napoleons? Sein Rätsel, das ganz Europa beschäftigt hat, ist bis heute nicht gelöst."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ait7ArIqldVII6DHSR1c3LJOzdU.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9zYXDMmhBKTbCbImJclf9hEbqZC.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":11710,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ait7ArIqldVII6DHSR1c3LJOzdU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ait7ArIqldVII6DHSR1c3LJOzdU.jpg","language":"it","width":1022,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ait7ArIqldVII6DHSR1c3LJOzdU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ait7ArIqldVII6DHSR1c3LJOzdU.jpg","language":"it","width":1022,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/koHLRzQ7A2M5XWQ3KCSvMCMumZJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/koHLRzQ7A2M5XWQ3KCSvMCMumZJ.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sQMgWXrhvzHylyXCPt7myVSG96I.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sQMgWXrhvzHylyXCPt7myVSG96I.jpg","language":"en","width":1904,"height":2857},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sQMgWXrhvzHylyXCPt7myVSG96I.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sQMgWXrhvzHylyXCPt7myVSG96I.jpg","language":"en","width":